{"type":"message","id":"a58a90a8","parentId":"d296cc15","timestamp":"2026-04-24T13:33:24.613Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The search requires user authorization. I need to inform the user about this. Since the current identity is \"bot-only\", I can only search for users that are visible to the bot/app. I should explain the situation to the user.\n\nActually, I should inform the user that I need them to authorize the search, and also clarify what they mean by \"赵晨旭的openclaw\" - are they referring to a person or a bot?\n\nWait, actually the user might mean \"赵晨旭's OpenClaw\" - meaning Zhao Chenxu's OpenClaw agent/bot that they are running. If that's the case, I need to understand how to add another OpenClaw bot to a Feishu group. \n\nBut the OpenClaw bot itself wouldn't show up in Feishu's user directory search since it's not a Feishu user - OpenClaw is a separate system that just happens to integrate with Feishu. To create a group with another OpenClaw agent, I'd need to know their Feishu open_id or bot information, or have the user provide the specific chat ID where both bots are already participating.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"需要你授权才能搜索通讯录。另外关于\"赵晨旭的 OpenClaw\"——这个是指：\n\n- **赵晨旭本人**（某个飞书账号）？\n- **赵晨旭的 AI 助手**（另一个 OpenClaw 机器人）？\n\n两者的处理方式不同。如果是另一个 OpenClaw 机器人，需要知道它的飞书机器人 App ID 或者已加入的群聊才能拉到一起。你知道更多细节吗？🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":382,"output":327,"cacheRead":45691,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":46400,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777037593133,"responseId":"chatcmpl-ba4f5f90-3c5f-4ff6-b893-acb03ab16e12"}}
