{"type":"message","id":"6c7cc62b","parentId":"ec1bed3d","timestamp":"2026-04-24T13:35:08.051Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user has provided the App ID of Zhao Chenxu's OpenClaw bot: `cli_a961d5100db85cca`. Now I need to create a group chat and add both bots to it.\n\nMy bot's App ID is `cli_a961d51ee038dcd1` and Zhao's bot is `cli_a961d5100db85cca`.\n\nI can use `lark-cli` to create a group and add members. Let me check what commands are available.\n\nActually, looking at the tools available, I have `feishu_chat` which can search groups and `feishu_chat_members` to get members. But to create a group, I might need to use `lark-cli`.\n\n\nLet me start by creating a group using `lark-cli chat create` or a similar command.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"好，先用 lark-cli 创建一个群，再把两个机器人都加进去～\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_bwd18wvpwjrn_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"lark-cli chat create --name \"双机器人群聊\" --bot-ids cli_a961d51ee038dcd1,cli_a961d5100db85cca 2>&1","timeout":20}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":487,"output":265,"cacheRead":47035,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":47787,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777037698935,"responseId":"chatcmpl-2c19fae3-cb9b-40fa-979e-de19e0c903c7"}}
