{"type":"message","id":"104e6fcf","parentId":"0de36329","timestamp":"2026-04-24T13:35:21.641Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_atgt3t1rvzoo_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Create a group chat; user/bot; creates private/public chats, invites users/bots, optionally sets bot manager\n\nUsage:\n  lark-cli im +chat-create [flags]\n\nFlags:\n      --bots string          comma-separated bot app IDs (cli_xxx) to invite, max 5\n      --description string   group description (max 100 chars)\n      --dry-run              print request without executing\n      --format string        output format: json (default) | pretty | table | ndjson | csv (default \"json\")\n  -h, --help                 help for +chat-create\n  -q, --jq string            jq expression to filter JSON output\n      --name string          group name (required for public groups, max 60 chars)\n      --owner string         owner open_id (ou_xxx); defaults to bot (--as bot) or authorized user (--as user)\n      --set-bot-manager      set the bot that creates this chat as manager (bot identity only)\n      --type string          chat type (private|public) (default \"private\")\n      --users string         comma-separated user open_ids (ou_xxx) to invite, max 50"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":0,"durationMs":59,"aggregated":"Create a group chat; user/bot; creates private/public chats, invites users/bots, optionally sets bot manager\n\nUsage:\n  lark-cli im +chat-create [flags]\n\nFlags:\n      --bots string          comma-separated bot app IDs (cli_xxx) to invite, max 5\n      --description string   group description (max 100 chars)\n      --dry-run              print request without executing\n      --format string        output format: json (default) | pretty | table | ndjson | csv (default \"json\")\n  -h, --help                 help for +chat-create\n  -q, --jq string            jq expression to filter JSON output\n      --name string          group name (required for public groups, max 60 chars)\n      --owner string         owner open_id (ou_xxx); defaults to bot (--as bot) or authorized user (--as user)\n      --set-bot-manager      set the bot that creates this chat as manager (bot identity only)\n      --type string          chat type (private|public) (default \"private\")\n      --users string         comma-separated user open_ids (ou_xxx) to invite, max 50","cwd":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1777037721638}}
{"type":"message","id":"d3c96aab","parentId":"104e6fcf","timestamp":"2026-04-24T13:35:26.570Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Now I can create a group chat and add both bots. My bot is `cli_a961d51ee038dcd1` and Zhao's bot is `cli_a961d5100db85cca`. Let me create a private group with both bots.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_eot0z4ax8hm4_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"lark-cli im +chat-create --name \"双机器人群聊\" --bots cli_a961d51ee038dcd1,cli_a961d5100db85cca --type private --set-bot-manager 2>&1","timeout":20}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":326,"output":136,"cacheRead":49275,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":49737,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777037721643,"responseId":"chatcmpl-3cd777db-42a7-47a6-a80d-948bb535ba1c"}}
{"type":"message","id":"fc033176","parentId":"d3c96aab","timestamp":"2026-04-24T13:35:27.068Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_eot0z4ax8hm4_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"ok\": false,\n  \"identity\": \"bot\",\n  \"error\": {\n    \"type\": \"permission\",\n    \"code\": 99991672,\n    \"message\": \"Permission denied [99991672]\",\n    \"hint\": \"check app permissions or re-authorize: lark-cli auth login\",\n    \"detail\": null\n  }\n}\n\n(Command exited with code 1)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":1,"durationMs":352,"aggregated":"{\n  \"ok\": false,\n  \"identity\": \"bot\",\n  \"error\": {\n    \"type\": \"permission\",\n    \"code\": 99991672,\n    \"message\": \"Permission denied [99991672]\",\n    \"hint\": \"check app permissions or re-authorize: lark-cli auth login\",\n    \"detail\": null\n  }\n}\n\n(Command exited with code 1)","cwd":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1777037727063}}
{"type":"message","id":"95f93634","parentId":"fc033176","timestamp":"2026-04-24T13:35:39.650Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Permission denied. The bot doesn't have permission to create a group chat with other bots. This might be a limitation of the bot identity - bots can only add other bots if they have the right permissions, or maybe bots can't create group chats with other bots at all via API.\n\nLet me think about alternatives:\n1. The user could manually create a group and add both bots\n2. I could try creating a user-level chat instead, but that requires user identity\n\nActually, looking at the permission error, the bot might simply not have the `im:chat:create` permission. This could be a limitation of the bot token - only user tokens can create group chats with multiple bots, or perhaps bots need special permissions.\n \nI could try using a user identity to create the chat instead, but since I'm running as a bot, I'd need to switch to a user-default identity. The other option is to ask the user to manually create the group and add both bots to it.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"权限不够——机器人身份无法创建包含其他机器人的群聊。这可能是飞书对 Bot Token 的限制。\n\n**最简单的方案：** 你手动创建一个群，然后把两个机器人都加进去：\n\n1. 在飞书里新建一个群\n2. 把我的机器人（`cli_a961d51ee038dcd1`）加进去\n3. 把赵晨旭的机器人（`cli_a961d5100db85cca`）也加进去\n\n或者如果你想让我以用户身份来操作，可以重新绑定身份，这样就能代你创建群聊了～ 🦞"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":110,"output":321,"cacheRead":49723,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":50154,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777037727069,"responseId":"chatcmpl-5db6be9b-24aa-48fc-bed1-9951429bf1d1"}}
