{"type":"message","id":"f6a423e6","parentId":"eb1312ae","timestamp":"2026-04-24T13:38:15.898Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"System: [2026-04-24 13:38:13 UTC] Feishu[default] DM | ou_23ab1a1db6759ee9ae44a8e441a52153 [msg:om_x100b51836a99fc80b25463bb2d407ce]\n\nConversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"message_id\": \"om_x100b51836a99fc80b25463bb2d407ce\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"ou_23ab1a1db6759ee9ae44a8e441a52153\",\n  \"sender\": \"ou_23ab1a1db6759ee9ae44a8e441a52153\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-04-24 13:38 UTC\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"ou_23ab1a1db6759ee9ae44a8e441a52153\",\n  \"id\": \"ou_23ab1a1db6759ee9ae44a8e441a52153\",\n  \"name\": \"ou_23ab1a1db6759ee9ae44a8e441a52153\"\n}\n```\n\n我和她进一个群里了，你怎么进去"}],"timestamp":1777037895846}}
{"type":"message","id":"3882deac","parentId":"f6a423e6","timestamp":"2026-04-24T13:38:29.864Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user and Zhao Chenxu's bot are already in a group chat. Now the user is asking how I (the current bot) can join that group. I need the chat_id of that group to be able to join it. But actually, bots can be added to groups by other bots or users through the Feishu app interface - I can't proactively join a group on my own.\n\nWait, but maybe the user has already added my bot to the group and now I just need to find the group. Or maybe the user wants to know how to add me to the group.\n\nLet me think... The user said \"我和她进一个群里了\" (her and I are in the same group). \n\nSo the user and Zhao Chenxu's bot are already in a group, but I haven't been added yet. The user is asking how I can join - which means they want me in there too. To make this work, I need to know either the group name or chat ID so I can be added, or I could search for group chats I'm already part of. Let me try searching for the group first, though I'll need the user's authorization to do that.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"你们已经在一个群了！来，我看看能不能找到那个群～\n\n先搜索一下群列表：\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_function_jlha98b4fnil_1","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"lark-cli im +chat-search 2>&1","timeout":15}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":2456,"output":304,"cacheRead":47483,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":50243,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1777037895900,"responseId":"chatcmpl-6d618570-b055-4145-8c79-5fbfed7cd247"}}
{"type":"message","id":"38153b57","parentId":"3882deac","timestamp":"2026-04-24T13:38:30.283Z","message":{"role":"toolResult","toolCallId":"call_function_jlha98b4fnil_1","toolName":"exec","content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"ok\": false,\n  \"identity\": \"bot\",\n  \"error\": {\n    \"type\": \"validation\",\n    \"message\": \"--query and --member-ids cannot both be empty; provide at least one (e.g. --query \\\"team-name\\\" or --member-ids \\\"ou_xxx\\\")\"\n  }\n}\n\n(Command exited with code 2)"}],"details":{"status":"completed","exitCode":2,"durationMs":274,"aggregated":"{\n  \"ok\": false,\n  \"identity\": \"bot\",\n  \"error\": {\n    \"type\": \"validation\",\n    \"message\": \"--query and --member-ids cannot both be empty; provide at least one (e.g. --query \\\"team-name\\\" or --member-ids \\\"ou_xxx\\\")\"\n  }\n}\n\n(Command exited with code 2)","cwd":"/home/gem/workspace/agent/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1777037910280}}
