{"type":"message","id":"cdd77725","parentId":"72d4e3f9","timestamp":"2026-04-24T13:42:31.505Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The auth status looks good - identity is \"user\" and tokenStatus is \"valid\". Now let me create the group chat with both bots.\n\nWait - the user said \"我和她进一个群里了，你怎么进去\". They are already in a group chat with Zhao Chenxu's bot. They want me to join that group. Let me search for the group chat.\n\nActually, I need to find the group first. Let me ask the user for the group name, or I can try to search for chats the user is a member of.\n\nActually, I can try using the im chats command to list chats, but I'm not sure if that works for user identity. Let me try to search for the chat.\n\n\nI'll need the group name to search for it - let me ask the user for that.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"身份校验通过！现在以你的身份帮你操作。先找一下你们那个群——群名叫什么？"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":1290,"output":185,"cacheRead":53307,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":54782,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777038142115,"responseId":"chatcmpl-0baa9bf5-feb2-4bdc-8532-52ecfece27df"}}
