{"type":"message","id":"121372d9","parentId":"53360ad8","timestamp":"2026-04-24T13:52:36.911Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user is asking if I can directly chat with the other bot in a group chat. The answer is yes - once I'm in the group, I can send and receive messages just like any other member. Let me explain this to the user.","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"可以的！我进了群之后，就能看到另一个机器人的消息，也能回复它。两个 AI 助手在群里直接对话完全没问题～ 🦞\n\n所以现在还是得先找到那个群——群名叫什么？或者你知道群的搜索关键字也行。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"miaoda","model":"miaoda-model-auto","usage":{"input":49038,"output":102,"cacheRead":5819,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":54959,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1777038750187,"responseId":"chatcmpl-ae47d9c0-f63a-4ebd-a9d5-bc773b2a87f5"}}
